WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.950
Hey, everybody.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:06.610
We love introducing you to new podcasts that we think are worth checking out, and today

3
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.990
we want to tell you about Unpaused with Dr. Mary Claire Haver.

4
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:16.030
So if you don't know Dr. Haver, she's a board-certified OB-GYN.

5
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:23.910
She is a menopause expert, and she just has this very empowering voice for women's health.

6
00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:29.590
She started Unpaused because she realized so many of us feel totally lost when it comes

7
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.590
to our bodies changing.

8
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.650
I know I did.

9
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.990
She talks about what's going on with your energy, your sleep, metabolism, all of it.

10
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.910
And she breaks stuff down in a very relatable way.

11
00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:46.830
She goes beyond just medical stuff, and she really talks about how to live your best, most

12
00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.170
unapologetic life at any age.

13
00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:52.250
And she's had some amazing guests, like Leanne Morgan.

14
00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.190
We love her.

15
00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.050
We love her.

16
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.190
And really, she's just talking about what it means to grow, change, and keep going no matter

17
00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.270
where you are in life.

18
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:05.130
So take a listen to the trailer and be sure to search for Unpaused with Dr. Mary Claire

19
00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:07.310
Haver wherever you get your podcasts.

20
00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:09.770
Hi, I'm Dr. Mary Claire Haver.

21
00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:14.430
I'm a board-certified obstetrician, gynecologist, and certified menopause practitioner.

22
00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:18.750
And I'm so excited to tell you about my new podcast, Unpaused.

23
00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:23.250
What I hear from women every day is they want more for themselves.

24
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.770
Yet here's the reality.

25
00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:29.050
As women, we've been expected to serve and fade.

26
00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:35.070
We were raised to believe that our values lie in how much we give, how quiet we stay, and

27
00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:38.170
how well we put everyone else's needs before our own.

28
00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:42.490
And then, when we hit midlife, the world looks away.

29
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:45.430
But women are waking up, and they're saying, hell no.

30
00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.710
That's why I'm bringing you Unpaused.

31
00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.430
This is not just another women's health podcaSt.

32
00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:56.130
It is a place to have bold, unfiltered conversations about what it really takes for women to thrive

33
00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.430
in the second half of life.

34
00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:01.190
We'll be talking about everything that matters.

35
00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:07.150
Your hormones, yes, but also your identity, your financial power, your relationships, and

36
00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:09.250
the tools you need to build the life you want.

37
00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:15.270
Our guests include medical experts, celebrities, and powerhouse women living these experiences

38
00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:15.950
every day.

39
00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.590
Unpaused is about reclaiming our health span.

40
00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.910
Not just the number of years we live, but the number of years we live well.

41
00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:28.790
I created Unpaused because I have a vision for something better, and I know I'm not alone.

42
00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:34.350
If you're ready to write your own story, follow and listen to Unpaused with me, Dr. Mary Claire

43
00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:37.030
Haver, available wherever you get your podcasts.
